# Claude Code 2.1.316 (its alternate-screen layout), an empty field at rest and the drafts typed into it: one letter, the caret moved to the
# start of it (Ctrl+A), more letters, a long paste that becomes a chip, the caret on a letter after Left. Every pty read with its arrival in
# milliseconds from the harness start. Taken 2026-11-01 as claude-code-2.1.316-queue-inline.reads was (scratch HOME, network shut to 127.0.0.1,
# no turn, the keys typed by the harness). The session name and the project folder are made-up words; the pasted text is not echoed.
# The marks are the moments the screen was read.
